            <li>• Larger filter surface area (multiple layers or bigger screen)</li>
            <li> • Thinner wire diameter (higher open area, same mesh count)</li>
            <li> • Backflushing or cleaning system</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Step 4: Consider Process Conditions</h3>
